  triage:title "query_mailbox_metadata_counts defined but not wired into atm list" ;
  triage:description "docs/atm-rusqlite/query-diagrams.md:23-30: query_mailbox_metadata_counts is defined and documented but not wired into atm list. Counts are computed Rust-side via bucket_counts_for over already-fetched rows. Either wire the SQL count query into the list flow or add a note clarifying it is defined but deferred." ;
